SkillDesc: {
	WindTornadoSkill: Summons a vortex of wind blades at the tip of your wand.
	FireBurstSkill:
		'''
		Unleash a flame domain around yourself for {4:0.##}s. Enemies inside are repeatedly struck by Flame Bursts, which fall faster the more enemies there are.
		Each Flame Burst deals {0} and adds {8} [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/FireIcon][c/FF8F5A:Burning] buildup. It deals {6} extra when it hits only one enemy. Deals {9:0.#}% more damage against enemies affected by [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FF:Freeze] or Frost Fracture.
		Each enemy ignited inside extends the domain by {5:0.##}s, up to {7:0.##}s remaining. Casting again replaces the previous domain.
		While channeling {$Mods.伊蕾娜.SkillInfo.SkillName.FireLaserSkill}, right-click to quick-cast an equipped Flame Burst.
		'''
	FireLaserSkill: Hold to charge for {0:0.##}s, then channel a flame beam. Every {1:0.##}s, consumes {3:0.##} [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power], deals {2} to enemies along the beam and adds {4:0.###} [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/FireIcon][c/FF8F5A:Burning] buildup. Deals {6:0.#}% more damage against enemies affected by [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FF:Freeze] or Frost Fracture. Inside your own flame domain, beam damage increases by {5:0.#}% and its remaining duration does not decrease while firing.
	FlightSkill:
		'''
		While riding the broom, increases flight speed by {0:0.##}% and enables the Broom Acceleration key:
		Hold it to boost to {1:0.##}x speed, costing {2:0.##} [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power] per second.
		Tap it to dash in your movement direction, costing {3:0.##} [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power] with a {4:0.##}-second cooldown.
		'''
	HealSkill: Restores {0} to you or one nearby teammate over {2} seconds. Healing stacks.
	AlchemySkill:
		'''
		Right-click the [klicon/16,0:Item:Cauldron][c/E8C27A:Alchemy Cauldron] to open the recipe notebook, then research a recipe to brew it. Some recipes also require holding the matching recipe item.
		Brewing grants alchemy EXP. Higher alchemy levels let you research more recipes, brew faster and sometimes receive an extra batch.
		'''
	FrostVeilSkill:
		'''
		Grants you and nearby teammates 3 frost shields each. Each hit consumes one shield to block {1:0.##} damage (5% of maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power]).
		Shields last 60 seconds. If any remain at expiry, they refill for free and renew; once all are consumed, cast again.
		'''
	DollControlSkill:
		'''
		Consumes 20 [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power] to summon {0} dolls that follow you until dismissed.
		[klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/ElainaModSkills/Skills/DollControl/Commands/DollCommand_MineChain]Hold {2} and drag over an area, then release to have the dolls mine its blocks or break its walls. Targets too far from you wait until you come closer.
		[klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/ElainaModSkills/Skills/DollControl/Commands/DollCommand_OpenChest]Right-click a distant chest to have a doll open it: that doll brings back items you take out, and another idle doll delivers items you put in.
		[klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/ElainaModSkills/Skills/DollControl/Commands/DollCommand_PlacePlanters]Click or drag a block beyond your reach to have a doll place it. Dolls tend, plant, and harvest planters placed while they are out.
		Select this skill in the skill wheel to open the command wheel without switching your current spell:
		[klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/ElainaModSkills/Skills/DollControl/Commands/DollCommand_Mine][c/FFD27A:Mine Blocks]: area selection mines blocks. Chain mining and bringing back items can be turned on.
		[klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/ElainaModSkills/Skills/DollControl/Commands/DollCommand_BreakWall][c/FFD27A:Break Walls]: area selection breaks walls. Chain walls and bringing back items can be turned on.
		[klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/ElainaModSkills/Skills/DollControl/Commands/DollCommand_Cancel][c/FFD27A:Cancel Tasks]: clears all tasks.
		[klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/ElainaModSkills/Skills/DollControl/Commands/DollCommand_Dismiss][c/FFD27A:Dismiss Dolls]: recalls the whole team.
		With chaining on, tap to select connected targets of the same kind.
		'''
	RecallSkill:
		'''
		Summons a magic circle beneath you or a nearby ally. After 1.5 seconds, all allies standing on it travel to the chosen ally's spawn point.
		Both circles remain for 30 seconds, allowing unlimited travel between them. Recasting closes your previous pair.
		'''
	ShardbindSkill:
		'''
		Summons 15 ice shards that hunt down an enemy near the cursor, each dealing a small area hit, then unleashes a large ice burst for {0} in total.
		The final burst adds {1:0.###} [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FF:Freeze] buildup.
		Binds the target in ice for the duration, leaving it unable to act.
		Deals {2:0.#}% more damage and doubles Freeze buildup against [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/WaterIcon][c/66C3E8:Wet] enemies.
		Starts sealed. Triggering [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FF:Freeze] yourself unlocks one cast.
		'''
	IceConeSkill:
		'''
		Continuously fires ice cones, each dealing {0} and adding {1:0.###} [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FF:Freeze] buildup.
		Deals {3:0.#}% more damage and doubles Freeze buildup against [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/WaterIcon][c/66C3E8:Wet] enemies.
		Triggering [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FF:Freeze] yourself unseals one use of {2}.
		'''
	WaterBallSkill:
		'''
		Conjures a water orb with a {3}-second charge. Hold to keep aiming, or release to launch it once fully charged, dealing {0}.
		After traveling a certain distance, the orb bursts in a wide splash behind the target along its flight direction. At close range, it bursts in a circular splash instead.
		Adds {2} [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/WaterIcon][c/66C3E8:Wet] buildup on hit. Against [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/FireIcon][c/FF8F5A:Burning] enemies, deals {1:0.#}% more damage.
		'''
	WaterLaserSKill:
		'''
		Hold to channel a water beam. Every {0:0.##} seconds, consumes {3:0.##} [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power] and deals {1}, plus {2:0.#}% splash damage to enemies near the end of the beam.
		Each hit adds {4:0.###} [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/WaterIcon][c/66C3E8:Wet] buildup. Against [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/FireIcon][c/FF8F5A:Burning] enemies, deals {5:0.#}% more damage.
		'''
	MagicMissileSkill:
		'''
		Deals {0} to the target.
		Passive: Magic Missile ignores enemy defense. After hitting the same target 5 times consecutively, it deals splash damage equal to {1:0.#}% of Magic Missile's damage to other nearby enemies (the main target is not affected).
		'''
	MultiMissileSkill:
		'''
		Summons {0} floating orbs in succession. They follow you until they fire. Once all have fired, you can summon another set.
		Each orb fires a Magic Missile at the nearest enemy, dealing {1}.
		With Multi-Shot equipped, right-click while casting Magic Missile to cast Multi-Shot.
		'''
	AshenWitchSkill:
		'''
		Elaina uses [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power] to cast skills. Each point of vanilla maximum mana gained increases her maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power] by 1. Her bonus life is reduced by 50%. Each point of maximum life lost to Ashen Witch increases her maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power] by 1.

		When [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power] is insufficient, she can spend 1% of her maximum life to restore 1% of her maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power] for casting. This is unavailable while her current life is below 10% of her maximum life.
		'''
	MagicBarrierSkill:
		'''
		Requires the Ashen Witch skill to be enabled.
		Activate the barrier just before taking damage. It reduces damage by the same percentage of maximum life lost to Ashen Witch, consuming [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FF:Magic Power] equal to the damage blocked.
		Current damage reduction: {0:0.#}%
		When affected by certain damage-over-time effects, the barrier also stays deployed, granting complete immunity to those effects.
		'''
	WindSlashSkill:
		'''
		Unleashes a piercing wind blade that deals {0} to every enemy in its path.
		Weaker enemies are knocked back along the blade's direction.
		After touching a [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/FireIcon][c/FF8F5A:Burning] enemy, the blade ignites enemies hit afterward.
		'''
}

